``` OTD-0138 - Dormant Vendor Account First-Use After Extended Inactivity ```
``` Source: 02-detection/sigma/advisory/16_dormant-vendor-account-first-use-after-extended-inactivity.yml ```
``` Severity: high ```
``` PLACEHOLDERS in <angle brackets> must be baselined before use. ```
index=wineventlog sourcetype=WinEventLog:Security
  ((account_type="vendor" OR account_type="commissioning") auth_result="success")
  NOT (days_since_last_login=180)
| table _time src_ip dest_ip protocol function_code user host
| sort - _time
